% ============================================================================
% vitamin-deficiency-symptom.query — worked recall queries against
% vitamin-deficiency-symptom.adj (adj-facts-stdlib, BIOLOGY).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall with citation, backward recall (bind a
% symptom, find the vitamin), and honest abstention on vitamin_c (whose
% already-cited span names the disease but no symptom).
% ============================================================================

import "vitamin-deficiency-symptom.adj"

% Forward: what symptom does vitamin D deficiency's cited span describe?
? vitamin_deficiency_symptom(vitamin_d, $Symptom)

% Backward: which vitamin's deficiency is described as making people tired and weak?
? vitamin_deficiency_symptom($V, tired_and_weak)

% Honest abstention: vitamin_c's cited span names scurvy but no symptom.
? vitamin_deficiency_symptom(vitamin_c, $SymptomC)
